00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.110
a nice pantry ingredient.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.220
Thank you, Tasty.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.810
So when you're making caramel at home

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:08.970
it's important that you put
all of your ingredients in

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:09.960
